# UX workflow: create an explicitly empty Macro Page.
# Purpose: proves that the terminal Page add target previews no stale Macro
# content and that confirming it creates a Page with no implicit Macro slot.
# Expect: capture_changed:source_page=page_add_target, capture_changed:page_add_target=empty_page_created

0 scenario macro-automation-clean
80 capture screen source_page

# The next Page is a non-created preview and must not reuse the active Page.
180 encoder NAV 1
360 capture screen page_add_target

# Confirm through the ordinary NAV grammar. The new Page remains truly empty.
480 tap NAV 60
680 capture screen empty_page_created
